<template><section v-if="calculation" class="card score-explanation"><div class="explanation-heading"><h3>分数是怎样计算的</h3><span>{{calculation.source}} · 版本 {{calculation.version}}</span></div><p class="explanation-note">{{calculation.notice}}</p>
  <details v-for="step in calculation.steps" :key="step.key" class="score-step"><summary><span>{{step.name}}</span><span>公式值 {{step.rawValue}} → 计入 {{step.score}} 分</span></summary><div class="score-step-body"><code>{{step.formula}}</code><dl><div v-for="(value,name) in step.variables" :key="name"><dt>{{name}}</dt><dd>{{value}}</dd></div></dl><p>计算后{{step.max!==null?`最高计入 ${step.max} 分`:'不另设此层封顶'}}{{step.min!==null?`，最低 ${step.min} 分`:''}}，最终显示保留两位小数。</p><el-alert v-if="step.warning" :title="step.warning" type="warning" :closable="false"/></div></details>
</section></template>
